31,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,Good morning. I hope everyone slept well.,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,1,1,talk,Shizue,,Good morning. I feel a bit heavy-hearted knowing someone might be lying to us.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,1,1,talk,Asuka,,"Let's get to the point. If the Seer found something, they might want to hint at it.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,1,1,talk,Kenji,,Everyone! I know who the werewolf is! It's Shion!,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,1,1,talk,Shion,,"That was fast. A bit too fast, don't you think? Are you really the Seer, Kenji?","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,1,2,talk,Jonathan,,"@Kenji, that is a very bold claim for the first day. Are you certain?","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,2,talk,Shizue,,"Oh dear, such a serious accusation so early. Kenji, are you sure you didn't make a mistake?","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,2,talk,Asuka,,"If Kenji is the Seer, the game is practically over. But if he's the werewolf lying, he's trying to rush a vote.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,2,talk,Kenji,,I'm the Seer! I checked Shion last night and he's the werewolf! I'm not lying!,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,2,talk,Shion,,"A classic bluff. He's trying to frame me to gain trust. It's a clumsy move for a ""Seer.""","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,3,talk,Jonathan,,"It is a risky play either way. If we execute a villager, we lose a valuable vote.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,3,talk,Shizue,,"I want to believe Kenji, he's such a good boy, but we must be careful.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,3,talk,Asuka,,"@Shion, your defense is purely logical but lacks evidence. @Kenji, your claim is direct. I lean toward Kenji.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Shion"",""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,3,talk,Kenji,,See! Asuka believes me! Shion is definitely the werewolf!,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""Asuka"",""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,3,talk,Shion,,"@Asuka, you're being swayed by a child's confidence. Think logically. Why would the werewolf reveal themselves as Seer so aggressively?","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,4,talk,Jonathan,,I think it's safer to trust the Seer's claim in this instance.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,1,4,talk,Shizue,,"If everyone feels that way, I will follow the majority. I hope for the best.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,1,4,talk,Asuka,,The probability of Kenji being the werewolf and choosing to claim Seer immediately is lower than him actually being the Seer. I vote Shion.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Kenji"",""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
